  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7301.02 Scope. This chapter shall apply to all local governments who apply for a loan under the exceptional disaster relief loan program.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #13168, 2-19-21",
